      "description": "Monospace preserved-whitespace field, demonstrating its associated error state.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-coordinates\">G25 coordinates</label><textarea class=\"ds-coordinates\" id=\"ds-coordinates\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-invalid=\"true\" aria-describedby=\"ds-input-error\">Group:sample,0.123456,0.098765</textarea><p class=\"ds-input-error\" id=\"ds-input-error\" role=\"alert\">Line 1: expected 25 coordinates.</p>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#30363d;display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;}.ds-coordinates{display:block;width:100%;height:226px;min-height:110px;max-height:calc(100dvh - 235px);resize:vertical;padding:10px;border:1px solid #b9c2cc;border-radius:var(--radius-control,3px);background:#fcfdfe;color:#30363d;font:11px/1.7 Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",monospace;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;caret-color:var(--color-primary,#1764ac);scrollbar-color:#a5adb6 #f4f6f8;scrollbar-width:thin;}.ds-coordinates:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary,#1764ac);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-coordinates::placeholder{color:#606c78;opacity:1;}.ds-coordinates[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--color-error,#a32222);}.ds-input-error{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#30363d;margin:9px 0 0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--color-error,#a32222);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Suite navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "rail-current",
      "description": "Current PCA tool and visibly disabled planned analyses.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-rail\"><div class=\"ds-brand\">G25</div><nav class=\"ds-rail-nav\" aria-label=\"G25 tools\"><button class=\"ds-rail-item ds-current\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"16.5\" r=\".5\"/></svg><span>G25 PCA</span></button><button class=\"ds-rail-item\" disabled><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.3 8.7-6-6a1 1 0 0 0-1.4 0l-11.2 11.2a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l6 6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0L21.3 10a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4Z\"/><path d=\"m7.5 10.5 2 2m1-5 2 2m1-5 2 2m-11 7 2 2\"/></svg><span>Distances</span><small>Planned</small></button><button class=\"ds-rail-item\" disabled><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 10 6-10 6L2 9Z\"/><path d=\"m2 15 10 6 10-6M2 12l10 6 10-6\"/></svg><span>Models</span><small>Planned</small></button></nav></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#30363d;width:var(--rail-width,76px);color:#e5e9ef;background:var(--color-rail,#24272b);}.ds-brand{height:var(--toolbar-height,46px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.4px;border-bottom:1px solid #41464e;}.ds-rail-nav{padding-top:8px;}.ds-rail-item{font:inherit;width:100%;min-height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:12px 3px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:#e2e7ee;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;}.ds-rail-item.ds-current,.ds-rail-item.ds-current:hover{background:var(--color-rail-active,#3a4048);color:#fff;}.ds-rail-item:disabled{color:#b4bdc9;background:transparent;cursor:default;}.ds-rail-item small{font-size:9px;color:#adb7c5;}.ds-rail-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #afcff0;outline-offset:-3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Coordinate entry panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "coordinate-panel",
      "description": "Actual heading, hint and footer treatment for the single raised surface; textarea has its own preview.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\" aria-label=\"G25 coordinate data\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><label>G25 coordinates</label><button class=\"ds-panel-close\" aria-label=\"Close coordinate data\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg></button></div><p>One sample per line: name, then 25 comma-separated values. A name like <code>Group:sample</code> sets its group.</p><div class=\"ds-panel-footer\"><span>Processed in your browser \u00b7 Ctrl+Enter to run</span><button class=\"ds-primary\">Run PCA</button></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#30363d;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;height:30px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-line,#d7dce1);border-radius:var(--radius-control,3px);background:#fff;cursor:pointer;border-color:var(--color-primary,#1764ac);color:var(--color-primary,#1764ac);}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:#f2f5f7;}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary,#1764ac);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-primary:disabled{cursor:default;color:#747c85;background:#fafbfc;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-primary{transition:background-color 120ms ease-out,border-color 120ms ease-out;}}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--color-primary-hover,#edf5fc);}.ds-primary:disabled{border-color:#b5c3d0;}.ds-panel{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#30363d;width:660px;padding:13px 16px 14px;border:1px solid #b7c0ca;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 7px 22px rgba(28,38,49,0.14);}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;}.ds-panel-heading label{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}.ds-panel-close{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:24px;height:24px;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-control,3px);background:transparent;color:#505b66;cursor:pointer;}.ds-panel-close:hover{background:#f2f5f7;}.ds-panel-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-primary,#1764ac);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-panel p{margin:0 0 12px;max-width:75ch;color:var(--color-muted,#59636e);font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;}.ds-panel code{font-family:Consolas,\"Liberation Mono\",monospace;font-size:11px;}.ds-panel-footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:12px;gap:12px;color:var(--color-muted,#59636e);font-size:10px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "G25 Views' single-chart workspace",
    "overview": "G25 tools is a compact desktop analysis interface: one stable white chart, a charcoal tool rail and a narrow toolbar. Its visual authority is the user-pinned G25 Views composition with PCA_views' colored and outlined sample marks. The direction name records that existing commitment.\n\nThe chart carries the visual interest. Familiar Arial/Helvetica labels, blue-outline actions, subtle gray rules and small corners keep controls readable and subordinate to data. This is a code-first React, TypeScript, Vite and Plotly interface; no image composition is the design authority.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One dominant, stable white chart on desktop.",
      "Compact controls with visible pressed, disabled and keyboard-focus states.",
      "Individual sample marks with group color, shape and dark outline.",
      "Anchored coordinate entry with the last valid result retained on input errors."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Data First",
        "body": "Sample marks carry group identity. Keep grid, hull fills, regression and interface chrome visually subordinate to them.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Stable Chart",
        "body": "Keep the plotting frame and ranges unchanged for legend, label, hull and regression toggles. A new fit or component change can establish new ranges.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve chart dimensions and ranges when toggling the legend or geometry.",
      "Do use both group colors and marker shapes with dark outlines.",
      "Do retain the last successful chart on input errors and associate error copy with the field.",
      "Do label disabled future tools Planned.",
      "Do keep Arial/Helvetica interface text and monospace coordinate input."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add settings dialogs, permanent control sidebars, mobile adaptations, regional presets or point editors to this approved surface.",
      "Don't average away individual sample points when drawing group geometry.",
      "Don't introduce filled primary actions, decorative cards, gradients, illustration or a hero into this chart workspace.",
      "Don't treat synthetic review fixtures as shipping data or imply a large-data performance guarantee."
    ]
  }
}
